if {NPCs.has_met_old_lady} == false:
	Leticia: Excuse me?
	[wait time="3.0"]
	Leticia: Hello??
	"Old Lady": *grumble* *grumble*
	set {NPCs.has_met_old_lady} = true
	Leticia: Can I ask where are we?
	"Old Lady": I can't seem to find it...!
	Leticia: (I don't think she can hear me.)
	Leticia: Did you lose something?
	"Old Lady": I must've dropped it somewhere on the grass... [pause=1.0]"*grumble* *grumble*
	- Do you need help finding it?
	- Nevermind. [Leave]
		set {NPCs.leaving_conversation_early.leave1} = true
		[end_timeline]
	label help
	"Old Lady": ....What was that?
	[signal arg="old_lady_idle_right"]
	[wait time="2.0"]
	"Old Lady": You want to help?
	"Old Lady": Absolutely!
	"Old Lady": You see, I dropped something very important.
	"Old Lady": Deary me, I tripped earlier and I thought I was ok! I didn't realize I dropped something so precious.
	"Old Lady": I would very much appreciate it if you find it for me.
	- Alright
	- I'm on it!
		set {NPCs.old_lady_happy} = true
	Leticia: (I have no idea what she's looking for...)
	[signal arg="old_lady_idle_down"]
	set {tasks.task1} = true
	[end_timeline]
else:
	if {tasks.task1} == true:
		[signal arg="old_lady_idle_right"]
		"Old Lady": Have you found what I'm looking  for?
		- Yes
			if {tasks.has_rose1} == true:
				[signal arg="take_rose"]
				join rose (Rose) center [animation="Fade In Up"]
				Leticia: Is this what you're looking for?
				if {NPCs.old_lady_happy} == true:
					"Old Lady": Oh you found it! Thank you very much, deary.
				else:
					"Old Lady": Yes, thank you so much!
				leave rose [animation="Instant Out"]
				set {tasks.has_rose1} = false
				"Old Lady": Here's something nice for you.
				join key (Key) center [animation="Fade In Up"]
				Leticia: (Another key?)
				leave key [animation="Instant Out"]
				- What's this for?
				- Can I ask where are we?
				"Old Lady": Go on now, deary.
				[signal arg="give_key"]
				key (Default): [A key has been added to inventory.]
				set {tasks.task1} = false
				set {tasks.task1_done} = true
				set {areas.has_area2_key} = true
				[signal arg="old_lady_idle_down"]
			else:
				"Old Lady": Well, where is it deary?
				- Oh, I forgot
					"Old Lady": Don't be silly now! Come back when you've found it.
				- I'm not done finding it
					"Old Lady": Alright, I'll be waiting here.
				[signal arg="old_lady_idle_down"]
				[end_timeline]
		- No
			"Old Lady": Oh alright, you take your time deary.
			[signal arg="old_lady_idle_down"]
			[end_timeline]
	elif {tasks.task1_done} == true:
		[signal arg="old_lady_idle_right"]
		"Old Lady": Thank you for finding what I'm looking for, deary.
		[signal arg="old_lady_idle_down"]
	elif {NPCs.leaving_conversation_early.leave1} == true:
		- Help her
			jump help
		- Not now [Leave]